4?t=1754218187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Gems</strong> \u2013 Unlock new powers that may <i>seem</i> simple, but they'll definitely help.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Locations</strong> \u2013 Traverse enchanting forests, mystical caves, ancient ruins, and many other beautifully crafted hand-drawn environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Dialogues</strong> \u2013 From bizarre characters and questionable advice to overly dramatic villains, expect dialogue that's weird, witty, and unexpectedly relatable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Intense Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against formidable enemies using a handful of weapons and special abilities, and master your combat skills to emerge victorious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Unexpected Allies</strong> \u2013 Make friends with strange but lovable characters. Just remember\u2014they need your help too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Spots</strong> \u2013 Stay curious. Secret areas, weird side paths, and rewarding surprises await those who explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Visuals</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a simple yet unique 2D world that brings the story and characters to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delightful Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a playful and atmospheric retro-inspired score that sets the mood for every twist, turn, and awkward boss fight along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608890/extras/7a34a72286442d819cbf18210da6d8f4.poster.avif?t=1754218187\" width=502 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608890/extras/7a34a72286442d819cbf18210da6d8f4.webm?t=1754218187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608890/extras/7a34a72286442d819cbf18210da6d8f4.mp4?t=1754218187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
